  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Evaluation including financial audits.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Using monitoring and evaluation funds, DFID will commission independent audits on Technical Service Provider transactions and accounts as well as those of downstream partners where formal funding arrangements are in place. For small grants made to third party organisation under the SRF, a tailored and proportionate approach to audit will be determined to be informed by both the size of financing and the recommendations of any due diligence assessments. The proposed approach to programme expenditure monitoring will be discussed and agreed with the TSP during contract negotiations.</narrative>
  </description>
